   (wide binaries are NOT an a0 measurement by themselves: they probe nu(y) at y ~ 0.1-3 inside the MW's external field; this is only the sensitivity)
   IF                           y=0.03    y=0.1     y=0.3     y=1.0     y=3.0       [d ln nu / d ln a0 at fixed g_N]
   alpha1 (record kernel)       +0.485    +0.455    +0.385    +0.250    +0.125 
   RAR (MLS16)                  +0.458    +0.425    +0.376    +0.291    +0.186 
